{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_02f8b14f58cbc5df8576ce9b239b3a1e26d179175e985c4b04abe0f3931ee4b1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"danau5tin/tbench-agentic-data-pipeline@4489453eb3c2 snapshot e0d4b0f95d30ce67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_dd08bc185b10982886b4564db836cff582db8db0e9ac80f3b3a99df8eb0e9857","slc_f592b261c70b46c84e507876b2ea94263f6e5cd2777a6756ec7aded67f44fdc9"],"source_ids":["src_cf80ef25f5e25a2fb927ee4f4c8190a1"],"text":"Agents use role-specific scripts (e.g. get_task_parameters.py, create_dp.py, approve_datapoint.py) plus shared tools including validate_datapoint.py, patch_dp.py, and patch_additional_files.py.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_050c310343ee7feae2d43fd1f778d2b11c82a5caab9faf8c22bdcb6b81dec087","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"danau5tin/tbench-agentic-data-pipeline@4489453eb3c2 snapshot e0d4b0f95d30ce67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_31adf05f6434df1a838d9e43601968699cee97fa91198bd69356fc44bb2c4df7"],"source_ids":["src_cf80ef25f5e25a2fb927ee4f4c8190a1"],"text":"The generated datapoints are intended as training data for a separate scalable RL training project for terminal-based coding tasks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_074c88385add766d5003f517a96ddca017cdb3dcdce878615a1a57b6744b42bb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"danau5tin/tbench-agentic-data-pipeline@4489453eb3c2 snapshot e0d4b0f95d30ce67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1ae1f10dd9cea2df6dec5b5c055bb1d5709047920ce2ba4fdff743668efa3c30","slc_994622bf539f2f279c928f533661636ff2f54372787b808b16d618eb7ef7b6ce"],"source_ids":["src_cf80ef25f5e25a2fb927ee4f4c8190a1"],"text":"Idea generation agents take Terminal Bench seed tasks, generate multiple variations, select the best ideas, and output draft specifications to a shared workspace; refinement criteria are withheld until after brainstorming to maximize creativity.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_10f06002b3f2c0c34738394a3662fc1b35e4c1eedeeda44352572bb350b0989a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"danau5tin/tbench-agentic-data-pipeline@4489453eb3c2 snapshot e0d4b0f95d30ce67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b01825632152aa31ee8421a5e8e97f86a7c6fa2c47cdb923ca1d865ccac5b5db","slc_eaa9c4e9e4fb5a9d526e96b919a962aa8e4b852ed1f7f3c232172d0c41d8dff2"],"source_ids":["src_cf80ef25f5e25a2fb927ee4f4c8190a1"],"text":"The Task Manager exposes an API where agents claim tasks by type (e.g. get_next_task with an agent ID and task_types) and complete them with results via complete_task.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2701ceb0f8e858d5699f41f356870853169a7b1d2aa67bb1dfc5d65d367fe851","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"danau5tin/tbench-agentic-data-pipeline@4489453eb3c2 snapshot e0d4b0f95d30ce67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b46eef13808599e49f911d78f5738286a43889ba64ecd0ba066abcdcb0fc5902"],"source_ids":["src_cf80ef25f5e25a2fb927ee4f4c8190a1"],"text":"Each generated datapoint is a directory containing prompt.md, a dockerfile (Ubuntu 24.04 or similar), tests.py pytest functions, weights.json, and a files/ directory with resources such as broken code and config files.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2d2c107cf70f9f49db0a2ea0a6983581fb8fa5548bf255c27b70afadbb22c1d0","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"danau5tin/tbench-agentic-data-pipeline@4489453eb3c2 snapshot e0d4b0f95d30ce67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a0c9a5c0c9393d15895758c5a1df7a90919f9978c7340ef89f714680165cecb7","slc_b412e840fc9a9e72cf41e54275e6c2a1df542a8276a3bb9be4c8ecade3d0e179","slc_f5994c3c946e10a013f16dba54d2646acd60a21825ffc8ce95e253c994255b7c"],"source_ids":["src_cf80ef25f5e25a2fb927ee4f4c8190a1"],"text":"The pipeline runs three specialized agent stages (idea generation, datapoint building, quality review), with agents working independently in parallel and coordinated by a central Task Manager that prevents duplication and handles failures.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_552e163742f7f42b3fefc3f90e9dcab93ac1375334f1846f2226ec6aeec6e814","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"danau5tin/tbench-agentic-data-pipeline@4489453eb3c2 snapshot e0d4b0f95d30ce67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3a728f827a57b45c4225fb7f20b3b7fbfffe8fc79dc3ebf1c61e19c285f60b89"],"source_ids":["src_cf80ef25f5e25a2fb927ee4f4c8190a1"],"text":"Quality review agents check datapoints against quality standards, edit and re-validate as needed, categorize them, and either approve with metadata or reject with reasons.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.5,"id":"clm_5895287b01f0cf25aab589d0768ae7766de476164af741eae07fb02e9c0369cf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=inference; facet=evaluation","setting":"danau5tin/tbench-agentic-data-pipeline@4489453eb3c2 snapshot e0d4b0f95d30ce67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_42176da665e60ba0dbf5789d83b23a6be4a9726c3916c9ea83d36858eb3bd578","slc_7b296b55df415b13c8c3b6bbabd9fc0b34c5eac6c3b6d5be185cd6085a4b3832","slc_dfea2c4f3d96b9c1d0bbc861df8a8a42e8f5ab4a00bc0706ff787c913dc5e801"],"source_ids":["src_cf80ef25f5e25a2fb927ee4f4c8190a1"],"text":"The reported outcomes (331 validated datapoints, 100% Docker-validated environments, category and technology breakdowns) suggest the pipeline's output quality was measured, though these figures are README-reported rather than harness-verified.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6c34f9e6b8a9db29fbafed5c90ac612ebc2abbd3cdbde4a7ee94b35f180552fb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"danau5tin/tbench-agentic-data-pipeline@4489453eb3c2 snapshot e0d4b0f95d30ce67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_32ca9210bd377e37aee8217dc6b1537fb0ed20709a93398f33c2785fb06d1607","slc_9e6adfdb3e14f1d69901628964772f29ad410477a2942e1b6aefd933b83b3657"],"source_ids":["src_cf80ef25f5e25a2fb927ee4f4c8190a1"],"text":"Builder agents turn draft specifications into complete executable datapoints, iterating on a validation script until the Dockerfile builds, tests fail initially, dependencies are present, and test weights sum to 1.0.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6ce5bc5b736c28584d71c61550caff11cbfe26da5e1d196ce38cd422795b298f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"danau5tin/tbench-agentic-data-pipeline@4489453eb3c2 snapshot e0d4b0f95d30ce67","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7d66debccabe9165dd86420ebf05d8ce9d4b9f60f0b8bb2819e53245f4b42c54"],"source_ids":["src_cf80ef25f5e25a2fb927ee4f4c8190a1"],"text":"The Task Manager provides atomic task claiming to avoid collisions, automatic timeout recovery, parent-child task tracking, and real-time status monitoring.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:43:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_80068f0b236846dfad722d2e13238b4b"}
